; claude: the music applications (CATALOG.md's Music section). Laid out
; like office/: the programs here, software/ for the golden frames, web/
; for the browser.
;
; So far TinyMinimoog, the Model D's voice (Voice_minimoog, over
; audio/'s blocks: plan_synth_teaching.md) played from the keyboard, and
; TinySoundtracker, the first tracker, over audio/formats/mod
; (plan_audio_formats.md). Playing files of every kind is apps/media/'s
; TinyMediaPlayer. What it might contain next, each Tiny and after a
; famous original:
;  - more synthesizers after the Minimoog (TinyHammond, TinyTB303,
;    TinyDX7, TinyRhodes, TinyCS80, TinyJuno): the TR-808 and ReBirth,
;    the OP-1 and the OP-XY (plan_synth_teaching.md);
;  - the trackers after it (ProTracker, FastTracker's XM, Impulse
;    Tracker): more channels, instruments with envelopes;
;  - a sequencer (Cubase, 1989): tracks of MIDI notes on a timeline, a
;    piano roll, audio/'s MIDI player;
;  - a sound editor (SoundEdit, Audacity): a waveform to cut, fade and
;    filter, audio/'s samples and Spectrum;
;  - a score editor (Finale, MuseScore): ABC in, staff notation out.
; Built on audio/ (synth, mixer, ABC, MIDI), gui/, and appkits/file_menu
; for their File menu.

; the synthesizers' voices and our songs, apart from their programs:
; the tests play them without a screen, and apps/media's playlist has
; the tracker's song. The voices are Voice_xxx, each a Voice.S (the
; interface, a module type only: no implementation)
(library
 (name music_voices)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules Patch_text Voice Voice_minimoog Tonewheel Voice_hammond Voice_tb303 Voice_dx7 Voice_rhodes Voice_cs80 Voice_juno Voice_tr808 Our_songs)
 (modules_without_implementation Voice)
 (libraries audio audio_instruments audio_effects audio_mod))

